00:41:15.700 --> 00:41:19.420
And it was because when I started to break, I would cover my mouth.

1041
00:41:19.740 --> 00:41:31.240
It was so hard not to just laugh through the whole scene because he was so brilliantly being this cringy boss who's so inappropriate but is trying to do something good for the office.

1042
00:41:31.440 --> 00:41:32.980
Like all of his intentions, you know.

1043
00:41:32.980 --> 00:41:37.440
That was the scene that I think I broke the most in for this episode.

1044
00:41:38.320 --> 00:41:42.020
It was that with him just like grinding into that chair.

1045
00:41:42.020 --> 00:41:44.200
But you were making it worse because you were right next to me.

1046
00:41:44.300 --> 00:41:47.620
And if you notice, for the rest of the episode, we are separated.

1047
00:41:47.760 --> 00:41:48.360
We're separated.

1048
00:41:48.420 --> 00:41:51.380
Also, I don't know if you noticed, but I try really hard not to look at you.

1049
00:41:51.540 --> 00:41:51.780
Yes.

1050
00:41:51.780 --> 00:41:52.680
Because I was like, I couldn't look at you.

