00:42:40.900 --> 00:42:41.840
Oh my God.

1075
00:42:42.560 --> 00:42:45.600
You and I have become like obsessed with our own show.

1076
00:42:45.740 --> 00:42:46.540
It's so ridiculous.

1077
00:42:46.540 --> 00:42:47.420
It's a little odd.

1078
00:42:47.500 --> 00:42:48.000
It's a little odd.

1079
00:42:48.080 --> 00:42:48.220
