1094
00:43:34.160 --> 00:43:35.100
to my forehead.

1095
00:43:35.100 --> 00:43:39.760
It was like you had waxed your forehead in one tiny rectangle spot.

1096
00:43:39.920 --> 00:43:41.400
And a few of us had that.

1097
00:43:41.540 --> 00:43:45.960
A few of us like, I mean, I'm so fair that like my skin like shows everything.

1098
00:43:45.960 --> 00:43:52.280
But I had kind of like this like this rectangle hickey on my forehead of where that note card

1099
00:43:52.280 --> 00:43:53.180
had been there all day.

1100
00:43:53.360 --> 00:43:57.960
Well, I remember us walking around backstage getting snacks.

1101
00:43:58.700 --> 00:43:59.860
They didn't want us to take it off.

1102
00:44:00.580 --> 00:44:03.680
No, because then they'd have to, you know, it was a continuity thing.

1103
00:44:03.880 --> 00:44:06.280
Even they didn't want it to be in any way different.

1104
00:44:06.680 --> 00:44:10.020
Yeah, they took photos of us to make sure it was always in the exact same spot.

1105
00:44:10.160 --> 00:44:11.600
It wasn't too high or too low.

1106
00:44:11.600 --> 00:44:16.620
So and once they taped it on, they were really like, guys, please don't take your note card

1107
00:44:16.620 --> 00:44:17.340
off your forehead.

1108
00:44:17.620 --> 00:44:20.940
So imagine being like, oh, we have a 15-minute break.

1109
00:44:21.140 --> 00:44:23.660
I'm going to get some pretzels and a cheese stick.

1110
00:44:23.780 --> 00:44:28.260
But I'm eating the cheese stick and pretzels while wearing, you know, a note card on my

1111
00:44:28.260 --> 00:44:29.120
head that said Jamaica.

1112
00:44:29.480 --> 00:44:30.300
That's how we walked around.

1113
00:44:30.420 --> 00:44:31.760
Like we went to the bathroom.

1114
00:44:31.980 --> 00:44:32.140
Yeah.

1115
00:44:32.760 --> 00:44:33.580
Oh, my Lord.

1116
