There was even a deleted scene in there where Jim pranks Dwight after Dwight figures out

1129
00:45:02.980 --> 00:45:06.740
what his race is, Jim gives him a new card.

1130
00:45:06.740 --> 00:45:09.260
And he's like, here, here, you should have this new card.

1131
