1134
00:45:18.720 --> 00:45:21.820
things like, oh, man, you're annoying.

1135
00:45:22.200 --> 00:45:23.740
You're difficult to be around.

1136
00:45:23.940 --> 00:45:24.340
Yeah, yeah.

1137
00:45:24.460 --> 00:45:26.620
And he's guessing all these different things.

1138
00:45:26.840 --> 00:45:29.060
And then really, it just says Dwight on his forehead.

1139
00:45:29.300 --> 00:45:29.700
Okay.

1140
00:45:29.820 --> 00:45:31.540
So I heard there was a deleted scene.

1141
