00:47:00.840 --> 00:47:01.240
It was fake.

1179
00:47:01.240 --> 00:47:02.540
She made no contact with him.

1180
00:47:02.620 --> 00:47:07.180
Because people wanted to know, oh my gosh, did he have a big red mark on his face or anything

1181
00:47:07.180 --> 00:47:07.740
like that?

