00:47:26.900 --> 00:47:30.420
And there was also one time she didn't laugh.

1192
00:47:30.540 --> 00:47:31.960
And that's the time it's in the episode.

1193
00:47:32.200 --> 00:47:32.520
That's it.

1194
00:47:32.640 --> 00:47:33.140
That's it.

