00:47:44.760 --> 00:47:45.380
about to laugh.

1198
00:47:45.420 --> 00:47:45.640
Yeah.

1199
00:47:45.720 --> 00:47:46.460
And she's trying not to.

1200
00:47:46.660 --> 00:47:47.220
Here's the thing.

1201
00:47:47.320 --> 00:47:52.760
We got to know each other all so well that I know everyone's tell before they break.

1202
00:47:52.920 --> 00:47:53.040
Yes.

1203
00:47:53.040 --> 00:47:55.880
Like, it's just so, like, clear when someone's about to laugh.

