1288
00:51:37.300 --> 00:51:40.800
So you remember earlier in the episode when Mr. Brown starts his training, he explains

1289
00:51:40.800 --> 00:51:48.120
what a hero is, and it's an acronym, and then Dwight explains what he thinks a hero is?

1290
00:51:48.180 --> 00:51:48.300
Yeah.

1291
00:51:48.520 --> 00:51:53.480
Well, after all that happened, there was a scene where Michael stands up and creates his

1292
00:51:53.480 --> 00:51:55.320
own acronym for sensitivity.

1293
00:51:55.320 --> 00:52:05.300
And his words are inclusion, new attitude, colorblind, expectations, sharing, and tolerance.

1294
00:52:05.660 --> 00:52:09.500
And while he's saying these words, Dwight is writing them on a whiteboard.

1295
00:52:09.980 --> 00:52:15.680
And I look at the whiteboard and I say, Michael, that spells inceSt.

1296
00:52:16.920 --> 00:52:26.620
And then Steve tap dances and says, but it still works because incest is bad and discrimination

1297
00:52:26.620 --> 00:52:27.460
is bad.

1298
00:52:27.600 --> 00:52:35.300
But also, incest is something that happens in your family, and the world is our family.

1299
00:52:35.480 --> 00:52:37.420
Like, it's just this crazy ramble.

1300
00:52:37.720 --> 00:52:38.640
Just back away from it.

1301
00:52:38.640 --> 00:52:38.760
Yeah.

1302
00:52:39.260 --> 00:52:40.220
But he won't let it go.

1303
00:52:40.220 --> 00:52:45.440
And then Pam has a talking head that says, if he just rearranged the words, he could have

1304
00:52:45.440 --> 00:52:46.360
spelled insect.

1305
00:52:47.840 --> 00:52:56.140
And I just remember shooting that scene, and every time I had to raise my hand and very

1306
00:52:56.140 --> 00:53:01.200
matter-of-factly point out that it spells incest, then there was just this silence in

1307
00:53:01.200 --> 00:53:02.880
the room as everyone took it in.

1308
00:53:02.960 --> 00:53:04.140
And I was sad.

1309
00:53:04.380 --> 00:53:05.760
That went on the cutting room floor.

1310
00:53:05.940 --> 00:53:06.800
That's very funny.

1311
00:53:07.140 --> 00:53:08.860
So thank you, Alexia, for your question.

1312
00:53:09.460 --> 00:53:10.040
All right.

